ashing and is now organizing the groceries for storage or meal prep.\n\n> **Action**: She has completed washing fruits and vegetables and is now organizing them on the counter, likely preparing to store or cook them.\n\n---\n\n**Frames 3–6: Moving to Storage & Kitchen Cleanup**\n\n- In **Frame 3**, the woman, now wearing a blue hoodie, is seen from behind, reaching up toward a cabinet or shelf in the kitchen area.\n- In **Frame 4**, she is reaching into a high white cabinet, likely putting away items or retrieving something.\n- In **Frame 5**, she is standing at the sink, possibly rinsing her hands or cleaning up after handling groceries.\n- In **Frame 6**, she has stepped away from the sink, and the kitchen appears tidy. The sink is clear, and the counter is mostly uncluttered, suggesting she has completed her kitchen tasks.\n\n> **Action**: After organizing groceries, she puts away items in upper cabinets, cleans up at the sink, and leaves the kitchen neat.\n\n---\n\n**Frames 7–10: Transition to Living Area / Tidying Up**\n\n- In **Frame 7**, she walks away from the kitchen toward the living area, which features a loft bed with a ladder and a sofa below.\n- In **Frame 8**, she bends over a small white side table next to the sofa, arranging or cleaning items on it — visible are a striped container and what appears to be a small plant or decorative object.\n- In **Frame 9**, she continues to adjust or organize items on the table, focusing on tidying the living space.\n- In **Frame 10**, she stands up and reaches toward the loft bed area, possibly adjusting curtains, lights, or items stored above the bed.\n\n> **Action**: She moves into the living area to tidy up, arranging decor and items on a side table and then attending to the loft bed area — possibly adjusting lighting, curtains, or storage.\n\n---\n\n**Summary of Activities:**\n\nAfter washing and organizing fruits and vegetables in the kitchen, the woman:\n1. **Stores groceries** in upper cabinets.\n2. **Clean